[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0010","text":"好了，今天的休息室──\n……嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0019","text":"外国歌手"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0020","text":"…………、……？\n………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0030","text":"突然打扰了，不好意思\n有什么需要帮忙的吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0040","text":"说是去完洗手间就找不到自己的休息室了\n肯定是名字用片假名写的那个套路吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0050","text":"啊……那可真是难办，我们送她过去吧\n也把翻译软件打开好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0059","text":"外国歌手"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0060","text":"──、……！！\nThank you……！　…………、……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0070","text":"『想早点回到能好好休息的地方……』\n时差反应真是辛苦呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0080","text":"看她很难受的样子……真是太好了\n对了，不介意的话请收下这个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0090","text":"热敷眼罩，刚好带了一个过来\n比起干坐着应该能更放松一些……哇"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0100","text":"不愧是咲耶酱……\n粉丝都扩展到全世界了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600500_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
